OL,3,GNEWSAChristian festival 'devastated'
OL,4,Aafter man's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Archbishop of Canterbury said she
OL,7,Fwas "sad and shocked" to hear about the
OL,8,Ffatal incident.
